{"version":1,"content":"<p>《GTA6》有時會讓人覺得，它的製作成本和奢華程度甚至有些誇張。我曾用高壓清洗機清洗一艘船，眼看着衝刷下來的泡沫真實地堆積在角色腳下的混凝土地面上。我跑過一座有軌電車站，發現周圍有100多名各不相同的NPC，他們都在各自活動。頭髮會被雨水打濕，後背會逐漸滲出汗水。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/game/1586974.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T14:29:59.741911+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":137,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T14:18:47+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T14:22:57.435954+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T14:22:57.435954+00:00","content_hash":"14ba07418b560c545d732cc248d262cc54202df9b5e1c2a2787d026f007db29d","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}